970, and 93971) List the Z01.818 (Encounter for other preprocedural examination) as the primary diagnosis. The secondary diagnoses should identify the reason for the study and/or findings.","8":"Pre-surgical Vein-Mapping for Peripheral Arterial Bypass (93970 and 93971) List the Z01.818 (Encounter for other preprocedural examination) as the primary diagnosis. The secondary diagnoses should identify the reason for the study and/or findings."},"noncovered":{}}}]